      "text": "<math><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>b</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>",
