  "solution": {
    "text": "Focus of parabola <math><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>b</mi><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi></math> <em>is</em> <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br />Focus of parabola in option <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> is <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>6</mn><mi></mi><mi>b</mi><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br />Focus of parabola in option <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> is <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi></mi><mi>b</mi><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br />Focus of parabola in option <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> is <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>30</mn><mi></mi><mi>b</mi><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br />Focus of parabola in option <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br />Hence, option <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> is correct"
  }
